 The Lakeside Windsurf School teaches windsurfing on the lake from April to October, and rents boards and
 sails to its students and to visitors who bring their own experience. This repository holds the software
 of its booking desk, written in TypeScript with no runtime dependency.
+
+## Rental service
+
+`createRentalService()` from `src/index.ts` creates an in-memory service. Add boards or sails with
+`addEquipment({ id, kind, dailyPrice })`, where `dailyPrice` is an integer number of euro cents.
+Use `quote({ itemId, start, end })` to price a rental and `book(...)` to reserve it. Periods use
+ISO-8601 UTC timestamps at midnight; `end` is exclusive and must be the midnight after the last
+rental day. A single item cannot have overlapping bookings. Bookings are held only in memory.
+
+The future cancellation policy is full refund at least 24 hours before a booking starts and no refund
+when cancelled less than 24 hours before start. Cancellation is not currently implemented.
