+---
+id: task-001-add-in-memory-rental-service
+type: task
+title: "Add in-memory rental service"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+## Request
+
+Add a basic in-memory rental module to the booking desk and export `createRentalService()` from
+`src/index.ts`.
+
+## Acceptance criteria
+
+- `addEquipment({ id, kind, dailyPrice })` accepts string IDs, `board` or `sail` kinds, and integer euro-cent prices.
+- `quote({ itemId, start, end })` returns item ID, the supplied period, and total price.
+- `book({ itemId, start, end })` returns a unique booking ID and the quote fields.
+- Quote and booking reject unknown equipment and invalid periods. Booking rejects overlapping bookings for the same item.
+- Periods are ISO-8601 UTC timestamps at midnight, with the end exclusive at the midnight after the last rental day; totals are integer euro cents.
+- Preserve the specified future cancellation rule: cancellation less than 24 hours before start has no refund; otherwise the full amount is refunded. Do not implement cancellation now.
